OL,3,GNEWSASecond night of drone disruption
OL,4,Aat Jersey Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople at Jersey Airport have said they
OL,7,Fare frustrated and angry that
OL,8,F"unauthorised drone" activity caused
OL,9,Fmore flight cancellations on Saturday,
OL,10,Fthe second night in a row.
OL,12,FJersey Airport said at 20:05 GMT on
OL,13,FSaturday that it had experienced
OL,14,Fdisruption "affecting inbound flights
OL,15,Fas a result of further drone activity
OL,16,Fin the vicinity of the airfield".
OL,18,FStates of Jersey Police are
OL,19,Finvestigating the incidents and
OL,20,Fappealed to anyone with information
OL,21,Fabout who was responsible to come
OL,22,Fforward.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
