OL,3,GNEWSASecond night of drone disruption
OL,4,Aat Jersey Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Government of Jersey said it had
OL,7,Fbeen working on arrangements to reduce
OL,8,Fthe risk of further disruption and to
OL,9,Fminimise passenger impact. There were
OL,10,Fno reports of disruption to Sunday
OL,11,Fevening's flights.
